{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2023-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1694131200, "end_date": 1694822399, "month_true_total": 40, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:22:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "146247633", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084852578", "personaname": "MountainMan247", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198084852578/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 2279, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2271, "last_played": 1700298088, "avatar": "8e63250ae3f48d2d9e742a8560c31f23fa44ef07"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain holds a special place in my heart. It's nostalgic for me since it's a 10 year old game at the time I'm writing this. Even though rouge-likes have gone through a lot of iterations in the last 10 years, RoR remains a strong classic in the genre. It is charming, unique, and features a  tiny character in a huge world, giving the player a feeling of insignificance in the face of the larger universe. That vibe of the weird, foreign world is what really drew me into the game, but the random item combos and unpredictability of the runs had me coming back again and again. Tons of items to find and combine.\n\nThe game is not without flaws, and there are other rogue-likes that do certain aspects better or are better balanced for difficulty and player experience. The main issue I have with the game design is that you can play for a long time and get \"one-shoted\" by a single enemy in a run that was an hour in. There are a few specific items that help with this, (and it's honestly a worse problem in Risk of Rain 2) but it's still too random for some players taste. \n\nThis doesn't mean RoR doesn't have it's own unique contribution to the genre though; It has many, probably the chief of which is the art/music direction, and the sheer number of items. I love this game and I pop back in from time to time.", "timestamp_created": 1694641389, "timestamp_updated": 1694641389, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146149057", "author": {"steamid": "76561199013227981", "personaname": "GodlyGrilledCheese", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199013227981/", "num_games_owned": 106, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 6840, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6819, "last_played": 1713763961, "avatar": "47679dfea47fee80e390a95bdb9474c47b000413"}, "language": "english", "review": "AMAZING GAME", "timestamp_created": 1694487110, "timestamp_updated": 1694487110, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47413790225982666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146124906", "author": {"steamid": "76561198817777981", "personaname": "Juda", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Jusamiumiu/", "num_games_owned": 288, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 38, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 38, "last_played": 1694450510, "avatar": "664096923a48661a933520ed7ab25ee662199f0e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like risk of rain 2 very much and this seems cool game too but I really hate the fact that I cant keybind abilities to my mouse but overall still seems cool I will propably finish this game sometime", "timestamp_created": 1694450790, "timestamp_updated": 1694450790, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighte